flowchart TD
    comp_corp[Compute corpus version] -->create_run[Create run directory]
    create_run -->load_fix[Load fixtures]
    load_fix -->create_sesh[Create session]
    create_sesh -->select_checks
    select_checks[Select checks] -->req_art
    req_art[Write request artifacts] -->fix_art
    fix_art[Write fixture artifacts] -->check_mode

    subgraph run_check[Run Check]
        check_mode{Is structural check}
        check_mode -->|yes| struct[Run structural check]
        check_mode -->|no| gated[Run gate if present]
        gated -->judge[Run judged check]
    end

    struct -->Verdict[Record verdict to scores.jsonl]
    judge -->Verdict
    Verdict -->report[eval:report]
    report -->compare[eval:compare]

